      "problem": "Let $v=[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]$ and $w=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 9 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{aligned}].$ Find $4v+2w.$",
